I recommend you level teleport up two levels and then go down. You can
wait on the up stairs for the arch-liches. If you don't have
telecontrol, uncontrolled will likely also do, as it will desposit you
somewhere from dungeon level 1 to current+3. That's a large chance of
ending up above the liches.


